---
// Section 05 — Paper node 3F-0. Face images are placeholders until the original pixel-art faces exist.
import Section from '../Section.astro';

const paces = [
  { name: 'Light', items: '1–4 items per lesson', tone: 'light', face: 'face 1' },
  { name: 'Standard', items: '5–7 items per lesson', extra: 'default', tone: 'standard', face: 'face 2' },
  { name: 'Intensive', items: '8–10 items per lesson', tone: 'intensive', face: 'face 3' },
];
---

<Section id="pace" num="05" title="Pace and audio">
  <p class="prose">
    In the first conversation you pick your HSK 3.0 level, a pace, and whether you want audio. If you've studied
    before, you can start further in after seeing the lesson plan.
  </p>

  <div class="paces">
    {
      paces.map((p) => (
        <div class={`pace ${p.tone}`}>
          <div class="face label" aria-hidden="true">
            {p.face}
          </div>
          <div class="txt">
            <span class="name display">{p.name}</span>
            <span class="items">
              {p.items}
              {p.extra && (
                <>
                  <br />
                  {p.extra}
                </>
              )}
            </span>
          </div>
        </div>
      ))
    }
  </div>

  <p class="prose">
    Audio is optional, but recommended. Hearing the chunks in a conversation is the point of the dialogues. ElevenLabs
    is the first suggestion for two-voice dialogues, and you can connect another compatible provider. Without audio, the
    dialogue appears in the chat in hanzi, without pinyin, followed by the questions.
  </p>
  <p class="prose">
    Hanzi you can actually see. Where the chat supports it, the vocabulary table shows characters at 2.5× the base
    size. The system font works fine. If you want strokes closer to careful handwriting, the skill suggests Kaiti SC
    Bold on Mac or AR PL KaitiM GB on Windows.
  </p>
</Section>

<style>
  .paces {
    display: flex;
    gap: 24px;
    padding-block: 16px;
  }
  .pace {
    flex: 1 1 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 14px;
  }
  .pace.light {
    color: var(--text);
  }
  .pace.standard {
    color: var(--accent-light);
  }
  .pace.intensive {
    color: var(--accent);
  }
  .face {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 48px;
    height: 48px;
    background: #141414;
    border: 1px dashed currentColor;
    font-size: 9px;
    line-height: 12px;
  }
  .txt {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 4px;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .name {
    font-size: var(--fs-h3);
    line-height: var(--lh-h3);
  }
  .items {
    font-size: var(--fs-small);
    line-height: var(--lh-small);
    opacity: 0.7;
  }
</style>
